<resources>
    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="aboutBeginningBody">Rafeeq began with a simple idea from my elder brother. We are both software developers, and one day he decided to build an Islamic app that would bring essential Muslim needs such as the Qur\'an, Qiblah, prayer times and more together in one place. Later, I — Muzamil Ghafoor — joined him, and Rafeeq became a journey shared by two brothers.</string>
    <string name="aboutBeginningTitle">How Rafeeq began</string>
    <string name="aboutClosingStatement">Built by Muslims, for Muslims — for the Ummah of Prophet Muhammad (PBUH) and for the sake of Allah Almighty. ❤️ </string>
    <string name="aboutCommunityBody">My brother and I are here for you. You can request a feature, report a bug or share an idea with us. We will listen, and we will keep doing our best to make Rafeeq better for Muslims everywhere.</string>
    <string name="aboutCommunityTitle">We are here for you</string>
    <string name="aboutDesignBody">When we first started, we did not have a complete design plan. Even after adding features, we often felt that something was still missing, so we rebuilt the app\'s entire design system twice. With this latest version, we have tried to create something minimal, clear and pleasantly refined. The Islamic app Sadiq was also a meaningful source of inspiration for us, and I am grateful for it.</string>
    <string name="aboutDesignTitle">Our design journey</string>
    <string name="aboutFreeBody">I want Rafeeq to remain free for everyone for its entire lifetime, In Sha Allah. In the future, we may add an optional way for Muslims to support the app\'s development and running costs. Any support will be used to maintain and improve Rafeeq; we do not intend to take anything from it for ourselves, In Sha Allah.</string>
    <string name="aboutFreeTitle">Free for life, In Sha Allah</string>
    <string name="aboutLinkOpenError">Could not open this link. Please try again.</string>
    <string name="aboutPortfolioOpenError">The portfolio could not be opened.</string>
    <string name="aboutSubtitle">The story and purpose behind Rafeeq</string>
    <string name="aboutTagline">Your Muslim Companion</string>
    <string name="aboutTogetherBody">Since then, my brother and I have worked on Rafeeq as a team. We started again together, gradually implemented the core features and kept adding more over time. Whenever our other responsibilities leave us some time, we come back to Rafeeq to improve it and thoughtfully prepare the next update.</string>
    <string name="aboutTogetherTitle">Growing together</string>
    <string name="aboutUmmahBody">For me, Rafeeq is more than just another software project. My brother and I want to keep improving it for the Ummah of Prophet Muhammad (PBUH). I am deeply thankful to Allah Almighty for giving us the ability to work on something that may benefit other Muslims.</string>
